// Comment  : This file contains the bootstrap collection surface for ILC. It defines the first generic collection interfaces and
//            their shipped implementations, including list enumeration and a simple dictionary backed by parallel arrays.
//
// Type     : ILC source code fixture
// Date     : 2026-04-05
// History  :
